    "chunk_text": "geornlice b\u00e6d, \u00fe\u00e6t him scolde beon get\u00e6ht, & \u00fea t\u00e6hton him \u00fea \u00fee hine cu\u00f0on, hwilc he w\u00e6s. Ac swa se man nat, \u00fea dysigan mod leoga\u00f0, \u00feonne hi wena\u00fe, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6s mannes geearnung sy swylce \u00d0a sona, swa se ceorl geseah \u00feone Godes \u00feeowan swa lytelne & swa forseowonlicne, \u00fea nolde he For\u00feon \u00fee he wende, \u00fe\u00e6t swa sceort man & swa unf\u00e6gger on ansyne ne mihte n\u00e6fre habban swa Ac \u00fea \u00fea him to so\u00f0an ges\u00e6d w\u00e6s fram manegum mannum, \u00fe\u00e6t hit se ylca w\u00e6re, \u00fea forseah he Nu n\u00e6f\u00f0 he naht men gelices. \u00dea se Godes wer Constantius \u00fe\u00e6t gehyrde, he forlet \u00fea swi\u00f0e bli\u00f0e \u00fea leohtfatu, \u00fee he r\u00e6dde & Of \u00fe\u00e6re wisan, Petrus, we magon ongytan, hwylcere eadmodnysse man he w\u00e6s mid him sylfum, se Ac symble se ongebrohta teona acunna\u00f0, hulic gehwilc man by\u00fe innan on his dygolnysse mid him For\u00feon \u00fea oferhydigan blissia\u00f0 for \u00feam arum \u00fee hi begyta\u00f0, swa eac full oft \u00fea ea\u00f0modan blissia\u00f0 Petrus cw\u00e6\u00f0: \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee ic ongyte, \u00fees w\u00e6s mycel wer utan on \u00feam m\u00e6gnum \u00fee he worhte, & eac he Gregorius him andswarde & cw\u00e6\u00f0: eac swylce \u00fe\u00e6re ylcan cyrican Anchonitane biscop w\u00e6s \u00de\u00e6s fe\u00fee getugon mycle fotswylas & fornamon, swa \u00fe\u00e6t hine b\u00e6ron his hiwan on he",
